              "desc": "<p>标签垂直对齐方式。可以设置<code class=\"codespan\">&#39;top&#39;</code>, <code class=\"codespan\">&#39;middle&#39;</code>, <code class=\"codespan\">&#39;bottom&#39;</code>。</p>\n"
